  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapisign v2.0\n\t\tCapisign Help Guide\n\n### Capisign: Sending a file from Accounts Production to get e-signing\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Mon, 20 Mar, 2023 at  9:35 AM\n\n\t\tTo send a file from Accounts Production to Capisign you can click on this link. Alternatively you can also follow the navigation as shown below.\n\nNavigation: Accounts Production > Client Specific > Annual Accounts\n\nStep 1 - Once you are in Accounts Production, select the specific client \n\nStep 2 - Select the ‘Reports’ dropdown, and select ‘Annual Accounts’\n\nStep 3 - You will see a list of already generated Annual Accounts, select the ‘Action’ dropdown and then select ‘Send to Capisign’\n\nStep 4 - You will then be taken to the Capisign module where you can view the document and receive an email update. The client will receive an email link to e sign the document and the Capisign status will change to 'Signed' once they have completed the e-signing\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000117934\">Capisign v2.0</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000197763\">Capisign Help Guide</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Capisign: Sending a file from Accounts Production to get e-signing\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Mon, 20 Mar, 2023 at  9:35 AM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">To send a file from Accounts Production to Capisign you can&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(84, 172, 210);\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://app.capium.com/accounts/reports/\"><strong>click on this link</strong></a></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-weight: 400;\">. Alternatively you can also follow the navigation as shown below.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><div class=\"fr-draggable\" style=\"position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://www.loom.com/embed/b2d9d81078c84832a267ae4f76397372\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-presentation\"></iframe></div><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-weight: 400;\"><strong>Navigation:</strong> Accounts Production &gt; Client Specific &gt; Annual Accounts</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-weight: 400;\"><strong>Step 1</strong> - Once you are in Accounts Production, select the specific client&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-weight: 400;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9182190316/original/oeDJ0wHrBZKBV_7QiztkDXH_eGJCLnV48w.png?1678790129\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9182190316\"></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-weight: 400;\"><strong>Step 2</strong> - Select the ‘Reports’ dropdown, and select ‘Annual Accounts’</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-weight: 400;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9182190465/original/wtAdTyknzhKQWcKwDOSzEpQW0tfHBTecEg.png?1678790218\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9182190465\"></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-weight: 400;\"><strong>Step 3</strong> - You will see a list of already generated Annual Accounts, select the ‘Action’ dropdown and then select ‘Send to Capisign’</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-weight: 400;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9182190574/original/vGTEaj-FdV3zfeNzm1FILgrkjUqKbXT0TA.png?1678790294\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9182190574\"></span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-weight: 400;\"><strong>Step 4</strong> - You will then be taken to the Capisign module where you can view the document and receive an email update. The client will receive an email link to e sign the document and the Capisign status will change to 'Signed' once they have completed the e-signing</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-weight: 400;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9182191024/original/t2XMdtyEGqLj6LQfZ8cxJGWTgSfMQvOVyw.png?1678790651\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9182191024\"></span><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"l